<section class="bg-primary-100 dark:bg-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 text-lg text-center font-medium">
    <span class="font-bold">
      <Icon
        name="tabler:alert-triangle"
        class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600 inline-block align-text-bottom"
      /> Select Your Preferred Edition:</span
    > Choose from a range of Desktop Environments, Wayland Compositors and X11 Window Managers including
    KDE Plasma, GNOME, XFCE, i3, Wayfire, LXQt, Openbox, Cinnamon, COSMIC, UKUI, LXDE, Mate, Budgie,
    Qtile, Hyprland and Sway. Simply download and install using the online GUI ISO installer.
  </div>
</section>
